# private keys, never committed. A placeholder pasted into ssh-keygen's file
# prompt wrote a live key into the private repo's root on 24 Oct 2026. This
# repository is public, so the same mistake here is unrecoverable: a key pushed
# to a public repository is compromised the moment it lands, and deleting the
# commit does not un-publish it.
id_rsa
id_ed25519
*.pem
*.key
*_rsa
*_ed25519
ssh root@*
